/**
 * @defgroup Foundation_Workflows_DesktopValidation Windows and macOS Checklist
 * @ingroup Foundation_Workflows_Validation
 * @brief Manual acceptance checklist for every native desktop preset and configuration.
 *
 * Run this checklist from a clean clone or a worktree containing exactly the
 * release candidate. A preset identifies the target toolchain and architecture;
 * Debug and Release are configurations inside that one preset. Both libraries
 * therefore belong in the same `build/<preset>/artifacts/lib` directory and in
 * the same exported `dist/<preset>/lib` package.
 *
 * @section FoundationDesktopValidationMatrix Required Matrix
 *
 * Complete every applicable row. Do not substitute a Linux container result
 * for a native Windows or macOS result.
 *
 * | Host | Preset | Compiler | Debug | Release | Export | Consumer |
 * | ---- | ------ | -------- | ----- | ------- | ------ | -------- |
 * | Windows x64 | `windows_msvc_x64` | MSVC | [ ] | [ ] | [ ] | [ ] |
 * | Windows x64 | `windows_clang_x64` | Clang | [ ] | [ ] | [ ] | [ ] |
 * | macOS Apple Silicon | `macos_arm64` | Apple Clang | [ ] | [ ] | [ ] | [ ] |
 * | macOS Apple Silicon or Intel | `macos_x64` | Apple Clang | [ ] | [ ] | [ ] | [ ] |
 *
 * `macos_x64` may be cross-built on Apple Silicon. Archive inspection proves
 * the architecture, but an x86-64 executable test requires Rosetta or an Intel
 * Mac. Record which environment executed the consumer.
 *
 * @section FoundationDesktopValidationFeatures Feature-Set Matrix
 *
 * Debug and Release are not enough by themselves because module options change
 * the installed headers, compile definitions, and binary. Run the default set
 * on all four desktop presets. Run the expanded option matrix on at least
 * `windows_msvc_x64` and `macos_arm64`; run one non-default set on each
 * secondary compiler preset to prove that arguments are forwarded correctly.
 * Every row is a fresh export and must pass in both Debug and Release.
 *
 * | Result | Feature set | Fresh CMake arguments |
 * | ------ | ----------- | --------------------- |
 * | [ ] | Preset defaults | none |
 * | [ ] | Explicit full build | `-DFOUNDATION_FULL_BUILD=ON` |
 * | [ ] | Without Math | `-DFOUNDATION_MATH=OFF` |
 * | [ ] | Without TypeTraits | `-DFOUNDATION_TYPE_TRAITS=OFF` |
 * | [ ] | Without Containers | `-DFOUNDATION_CONTAINERS=OFF` |
 * | [ ] | Without Scheduling | `-DFOUNDATION_SCHEDULING=OFF` |
 * | [ ] | Without Time | `-DFOUNDATION_TIME=OFF` |
 * | [ ] | Without Functional | `-DFOUNDATION_FUNCTIONAL=OFF` |
 * | [ ] | Without Utils | `-DFOUNDATION_UTILS=OFF` |
 * | [ ] | Core only | all seven module options above set to `OFF` |
 *
 * If disabling one module breaks another module, record the failure as a CMake
 * dependency-model defect rather than silently changing the checklist. The
 * build must either support that combination or reject it at configure time
 * with a precise dependency message.
 *
 * @section FoundationDesktopValidationCommon Checklist for Each Preset
 *
 * - [ ] Record the commit SHA and confirm the worktree contains the intended changes.
 * - [ ] Record CMake, Ninja or Visual Studio, and compiler versions.
 * - [ ] Remove `build/<preset>` and `dist/<preset>` through `clean`.
 * - [ ] Configure the preset once with the fresh option.
 * - [ ] Confirm `CMAKE_CONFIGURATION_TYPES` contains Debug and Release.
 * - [ ] Build the `Foundation` target in Debug.
 * - [ ] Build the `Foundation` target in Release without reconfiguring.
 * - [ ] Confirm the two archives have distinct names and the expected architecture.
 * - [ ] Run one export command with no `--config`/`-Configuration` override.
 * - [ ] Confirm that export installed Debug and Release into the same prefix.
 * - [ ] Confirm public headers and all CMake package metadata were installed.
 * - [ ] If examples are enabled, confirm only Release executables and launchers
 *       exist in `bin/examples`; record them as examples, never as tests.
 * - [ ] Confirm Debug and Release imported locations select different archives.
 * - [ ] Build a separate consumer with `find_package(Foundation CONFIG REQUIRED)`
 *       and `Foundation::Foundation` in both configurations.
 * - [ ] Run registered native tests in both configurations.
 * - [ ] Record any use of `AllowNoTests` as “compiled; no tests executed,” not
 *       as a test pass.
 * - [ ] Repeat one fresh export with a module disabled and verify its metadata.
 * - [ ] Restore and re-export the preset defaults before retaining release artifacts.
 *
 * @section FoundationDesktopValidationWindows Windows Commands
 *
 * Run MSVC from a Visual Studio Developer PowerShell. Set `$Preset` to
 * `windows_msvc_x64`, then repeat with `windows_clang_x64` after confirming that
 * `clang` and `clang++` resolve to the intended installation.
 *
 * @code{powershell}
 * $Preset = "windows_msvc_x64"
 * git rev-parse HEAD
 * cmake --version
 * cmake --list-presets=all
 * Get-Command cl
 * Get-Command ninja -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue
 *
 * ./scripts/clean.ps1 $Preset -Dist
 * ./scripts/configure.ps1 $Preset -Fresh
 * Select-String -Path "build/$Preset/CMakeCache.txt" `
 *   -Pattern "CMAKE_CONFIGURATION_TYPES"
 * ./scripts/build.ps1 $Preset -Configuration Debug -Target Foundation
 * ./scripts/build.ps1 $Preset -Configuration Release -Target Foundation
 *
 * Test-Path "build/$Preset/artifacts/lib/Foundation_d.lib"
 * Test-Path "build/$Preset/artifacts/lib/Foundation.lib"
 *
 * ./scripts/test.ps1 $Preset -Configuration Debug -AllowNoTests
 * ./scripts/test.ps1 $Preset -Configuration Release -AllowNoTests
 * ./scripts/export.ps1 $Preset -Fresh
 *
 * Test-Path "dist/$Preset/include"
 * Test-Path "dist/$Preset/lib/Foundation_d.lib"
 * Test-Path "dist/$Preset/lib/Foundation.lib"
 * Test-Path "dist/$Preset/lib/cmake/Foundation/FoundationConfig.cmake"
 * Test-Path "dist/$Preset/lib/cmake/Foundation/FoundationTargets-debug.cmake"
 * Test-Path "dist/$Preset/lib/cmake/Foundation/FoundationTargets-release.cmake"
 * Select-String -Path "dist/$Preset/lib/cmake/Foundation/FoundationTargets-debug.cmake" `
 *   -Pattern "IMPORTED_LOCATION_DEBUG.*Foundation_d.lib"
 * Select-String -Path "dist/$Preset/lib/cmake/Foundation/FoundationTargets-release.cmake" `
 *   -Pattern "IMPORTED_LOCATION_RELEASE.*Foundation.lib"
 * @endcode
 *
 * Every `Test-Path` must print `True`, and both `Select-String` archive checks
 * must return a match. Use `dumpbin /headers` for MSVC or `llvm-readobj` for
 * Clang when recording the archive machine type.
 *
 * Validate cache overrides independently; then restore the default package:
 *
 * @code{powershell}
 * ./scripts/export.ps1 $Preset -Fresh `
 *   -CMakeArguments "-DFOUNDATION_SCHEDULING=OFF"
 * Select-String `
 *   -Path "dist/$Preset/lib/cmake/Foundation/FoundationBuildInfo.cmake" `
 *   -Pattern 'Foundation_FEATURE_SCHEDULING "OFF"'
 * ./scripts/export.ps1 $Preset -Fresh
 * @endcode
 *
 * @section FoundationDesktopValidationMacOS macOS Commands
 *
 * Set `PRESET` to `macos_arm64`, then repeat the complete checklist with
 * `macos_x64`.
 *
 * @code{bash}
 * PRESET=macos_arm64
 * git rev-parse HEAD
 * xcode-select -p
 * xcrun clang++ --version
 * cmake --version
 * ninja --version
 * cmake --list-presets=all
 *
 * ./scripts/clean.sh "$PRESET" --dist
 * ./scripts/configure.sh "$PRESET" --fresh
 * grep "CMAKE_CONFIGURATION_TYPES" "build/$PRESET/CMakeCache.txt"
 * ./scripts/build.sh "$PRESET" --config Debug --target Foundation
 * ./scripts/build.sh "$PRESET" --config Release --target Foundation
 *
 * test -f "build/$PRESET/artifacts/lib/libFoundation_d.a"
 * test -f "build/$PRESET/artifacts/lib/libFoundation.a"
 * lipo -archs "build/$PRESET/artifacts/lib/libFoundation_d.a"
 * lipo -archs "build/$PRESET/artifacts/lib/libFoundation.a"
 *
 * ./scripts/test.sh "$PRESET" --config Debug --allow-no-tests
 * ./scripts/test.sh "$PRESET" --config Release --allow-no-tests
 * ./scripts/export.sh "$PRESET" --fresh
 *
 * test -d "dist/$PRESET/include"
 * test -f "dist/$PRESET/lib/libFoundation_d.a"
 * test -f "dist/$PRESET/lib/libFoundation.a"
 * test -f "dist/$PRESET/lib/cmake/Foundation/FoundationConfig.cmake"
 * grep "IMPORTED_LOCATION_DEBUG.*libFoundation_d.a" \
 *   "dist/$PRESET/lib/cmake/Foundation/FoundationTargets-debug.cmake"
 * grep "IMPORTED_LOCATION_RELEASE.*libFoundation.a" \
 *   "dist/$PRESET/lib/cmake/Foundation/FoundationTargets-release.cmake"
 * lipo -archs "dist/$PRESET/lib/libFoundation_d.a"
 * lipo -archs "dist/$PRESET/lib/libFoundation.a"
 * @endcode
 *
 * Both architecture commands must report `arm64` for `macos_arm64` and
 * `x86_64` for `macos_x64`. Validate an option override, then restore defaults:
 *
 * @code{bash}
 * ./scripts/export.sh "$PRESET" --fresh -- -DFOUNDATION_SCHEDULING=OFF
 * grep 'Foundation_FEATURE_SCHEDULING "OFF"' \
 *   "dist/$PRESET/lib/cmake/Foundation/FoundationBuildInfo.cmake"
 * ./scripts/export.sh "$PRESET" --fresh
 * @endcode
 *
 * @section FoundationDesktopValidationExit Release Evidence
 *
 * Keep the command log and complete one @ref FoundationValidationReport record
 * for each preset. A row is complete only when the package consumer links the
 * correct archive; the presence of files alone is not sufficient.
 */
